---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"The Promised Trillion Dollar AI-Coding Market"}
  description={"About: The Promised Trillion Dollar AI-Coding Market. Forecasts say AI coding will be worth trillions of dollars a year."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Economics essay · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      The Promised Trillion Dollar AI-Coding Market
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      Forecasts say AI coding will be worth trillions of dollars a year. This essay lists who says so, labels each number by what it is, and names the assumptions the forecasts share.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">In plain words</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>The big numbers about AI coding are mostly guesses about the future, not counts of money already earned.</li>
        <li>Almost all of them assume that every new piece of code needs a large AI model, paid by the word, forever.</li>
        <li>If working code can be saved and reused, the cost of a repeated job falls toward the cost of the electricity to run it, and those forecasts would be too high.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/ai-coding-market/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /papers/ai-coding-market/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/ai-coding-market.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
